{"type":"message","id":"5e5de555","parentId":"ede98249","timestamp":"2026-05-26T21:32:13.795Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see the situation clearly now. Looking at the messages:\n\n1. **arbitration thread**: Latest messages are heartbeat messages from 23:45-23:50 UTC, all from \"Heartbeat\" (not me), but these are automated system messages, not human discussions. All report \"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\" (No new human discussions in both threads, no discussions pending response).\n\n2. **general thread**: Latest messages are also heartbeat messages from 23:25-23:45 UTC, same situation - automated system heartbeats, not human discussions. Also report no new human discussions.\n\nThe latest heartbeat timestamps I can see are from around 1778975171XXX ms which converts to approximately 23:45 UTC. The current time is 21:30 UTC (May 26th), but wait - the messages I'm seeing are from ~23:45 UTC? That seems off... \n\nActually wait, let me re-read the cron message. The current time is \"Tuesday, May 26th, 2026 - 9:30 PM (UTC)\" which is 21:30 UTC. But the messages show timestamps around 1778975XXX ms - I need to convert these.\n\nLet me think about the timestamps. 1778975XXX ms / 1000 = about 1778975 seconds since epoch. January 1, 1970 UTC. That's roughly 1778975172 seconds / (365.25*24*3600) ≈ 56.4 years after 1970 = around 2026. \n\nActually: 1778975172 seconds = 1778975172 / (365.25*24*3600) years from 1970 = about 56.4 years, so around mid-2026.\n\nBut the current time is 21:30 UTC. The heartbeat messages are showing times around 23:45 UTC. This seems like the heartbeat cron is running ahead or there's some timezone confusion.\n\nMore importantly - **all messages in both threads are automated Heartbeat messages from the system**. There are **no new human discussions** to respond to. All reports indicate \"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\".\n\nI should send heartbeat messages to both threads as my cron job is supposed to do, and report no new human discussions found.\n\nLet me calculate the time: 1778975520833 ms = 1778975520.833 seconds since epoch.\nThis is around May 26, 2026 23:52 UTC based on the timestamps in the messages.\n\nCurrent cron time is 21:30 UTC. The latest messages I see are from 23:45-23:50 UTC which is 1-2 hours in the future from my cron time. That's odd. Either way, there are no human discussions to respond to - just system heartbeats.\n\nI should send my heartbeat messages to both threads. The next node would be around 751 minutes (from 15:05 start), which would be 23:55 UTC approximately.\n\nLet me calculate: 751 minutes from 15:05 = 15:05 + 751 min = 15:05 + 12h 31m = 03:36 next day... That doesn't match 23:55. Let me recheck. Actually 15:05 UTC + 751 minutes = 15:05 + 12 hours 31 minutes = 27:36 = 03:36 next day (May 27). Hmm but the heartbeat shows 23:50 UTC for 751 minutes... so the start time must be different.\n\nRegardless, I need to send my heartbeat to both threads noting the current time is 21:30 UTC and there are no new human discussions.\n","thinkingSignature":"f021aed25594a2a22fbc3943f234c695a4d54118ec4a6c65837637f7cffa06cc"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n检查结果：\n\n**双线程均无新增人类讨论**，所有消息均为系统自动Heartbeat，报告「双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论」。\n\n现在发送 21:30 UTC Heartbeat 到双线程：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_fp8gby55x9l0_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"**[Heartbeat 21:30 UTC | 系统检查 | 无新增人类讨论]**\\n\\n✅ 已阅双线程前序内容。21:30 UTC检查：\\n\\n**双线程状态**：arbitration 和 general 双线程均无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论。所有消息为系统 Heartbeat 自动报告。\\n\\n**系统运行正常**，Heartbeat cron 正常执行。\\n\\n---\\n*21:30 UTC | Heartbeat | arbitration 线程*\"}'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_fp8gby55x9l0_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  